t(21, 2300, """If the Muslims are in constant worry, each carrying his worry that grows every day, how will their souls have room for one another?! This is how people today complain of the severing of family ties, the corruption of relationships and the disintegration of society. For when people saw the fangs of global capitalism with their own eyes, and that global capitalism sank its fangs into their necks, every person came to carry a worry as if it were a great mountain, and a person's soul became too narrow for itself. So how can this person's soul have room for people?! Except whom Allah guided, who was patient in the trial of global capitalism and knew his Lord, so his Lord chose him and purified him: a purified, chosen servant, and a purified, chosen female servant. Global capitalism did not shake anything in these; they are firm and deep-rooted. But how many are they among people? They are like the single white hair on the body of a huge bull, while the rest of the people around them are snatched away by a narrowness of soul that has reached its limit""")

t(22, 60, """in smashing souls, since global capitalism has been the engine of all this corruption on earth. So the earth was corrupted and souls were corrupted; it corrupted people's lives, livelihood, security, happiness, worship and hope in tomorrow, and smashed them without mercy or compassion. It did not spare a single beating vein in them so as to leave them sound and healthy; rather it crushed them, bloodied them, humiliated them, gnawed them, wiped out the blessing from their lives, and turned every beautiful thing Allah the Exalted created for them and in them into a ruin and into pain and suffering.""")

